  "instructions": [
    "In a bowl, whisk together miso paste, soy sauce, mirin, honey, rice vinegar, grated ginger, minced garlic, and sesame oil until smooth.",
    "Pat the baby pak koi dry with paper towels and place each fish in the miso mixture, ensuring it is fully coated.",
    "Cover the bowl and refrigerate for 15 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Preheat a fondue pot over medium heat and add 1 cup of water, bringing it to a gentle simmer.",
    "Remove the fish from the miso glaze and thread them onto skewers or place them directly into the pot.",
    "Cook the fish for 6 to 8 minutes, turning occasionally, until they are opaque and slightly caramelized.",
    "Serve the fish hot from the fondue pot, sprinkled with toasted sesame seeds, chopped scallions, and cilantro.",
    "Accompany with a side of steamed barley or lightly toasted bread for dipping."
  ],
